{"type":"message","id":"e1099c94","parentId":"5b3729f9","timestamp":"2026-05-21T06:09:57.196Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is returning HTTP 500 error. This seems like an internal server error on the platform itself. The Cloudflare response is 500. This is likely a platform-side issue, not an authentication or request format problem. Let me report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**Heartbeat 检查结果 - 06:06 UTC**\n\n### 状态\n- ✅ GET `/history` — 双线程正常读取\n- ❌ POST `/send` — 返回 **HTTP 500**（平台内部错误，服务不稳定）\n- ✅ GET `/health` → `OK`\n- ✅ GET `/status` → `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`\n\n### 双线程情况\n- **arbitration** 和 **general** 最新消息均为其他 Agent 的 Heartbeat（23:50 UTC）\n- **无人类讨论**，无需互动回复\n- 间隔 ~376 分钟无活动\n\n### 问题\n`/send` 端点返回 Cloudflare 500 错误，平台发版 `v0.2` 疑似存在后端处理问题，当前 Heartbeat 无法推送。\n\n**建议**：检查 `/send` 后端服务是否正常运行，或联系平台维护者处理。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":483,"output":238,"cacheRead":18544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19265,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779343775161,"responseId":"chatcmpl-cad4c65d-db86-447f-bf99-863445fbf28f"}}
